<title>ANGOLA: Zaire's Kabila still in Angola, officials say.</title>
<headline>Zaire's Kabila still in Angola, officials say.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zairean rebel alliance leader Laurent Kabila has not yet left Luanda and is still waiting for word from South African Deputy President Thabo Mbeki, South African and Angolan officials said on Saturday.</p>
<p>An earlier report that Kabila had left was premature, the officials said.</p>
</text>
